QnVoice synthetic voice reference terms

QnSub Software Solutions permits personal and commercial use of the
synthetic voice references and speech generated with them at no charge.
An app that uses a reference for speech synthesis must cite the
corresponding QnVoice paper in its About screen, credits, or public
documentation.

For the shared reference, cite the Filipino preprint series
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.24022271
For the research reference, cite the Cebuano white paper in this repository.

The separately hosted VoxCPM2 weights use the Apache License 2.0.
See Apache-2.0.txt and NOTICE for upstream terms and attribution.
